uardrails:** A daily 5 AM health check self-tests every endpoint and the fully-stubbed v2/v3/v4 R&D surfaces (never live `claude`, never touching real data or the live port), writing dated reports.\n\n- **Branding:** Presented as a **Ghost World Labs** tool \"Powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢.\"\n\nThe frozen design/build history lives in `planning/rnd-v2â€¦v4/`; v4 is built (9 waves GREEN, 637 passed) and merged to master."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1cea3e5-c207-4c8c-ad8d-afa54da0b79d","uuid":"16a088f8-61de-4098-92a3-d71098a8ae22","request_id":"req_011Cc1JQX8oqn8dbgYmPMo1d"}
